    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProxyProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProxyProjectionFactory</code></a> that adds support to use <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a>-annotated methods on a projection interface\nto evaluate the contained SpEL expression to define the outcome of the method call.",
      "translation": "一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProxyProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProxyProjectionFactory</code></a>，它支持在投影接口上使用带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> 注解的方法，以评估所包含的 SpEL 表达式来确定方法调用的结果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Inspects the given target type for methods with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> annotations and caches the result. Will create a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/SpelEvaluatingMethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>SpelEvaluatingMethodInterceptor</code></a> if an annotation was found or return the delegate as is if not.",
      "translation": "检查给定目标类型中具有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> 注解的方法并缓存结果。如果找到注解，将创建一个\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/SpelEvaluatingMethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>SpelEvaluatingMethodInterceptor</code></a>；否则，直接返回代理对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
