    {
      "source": "Registers the given <a href=\"MethodInterceptorFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>MethodInterceptorFactory</code></a> to be used with the factory. Factories registered later enjoy\nprecedence over previously registered ones.",
